Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> devices cmds
Rule 2     devices -> device devices
Rule 3     devices -> device
Rule 4     id_any -> NAMEDEVICE
Rule 5     id_any -> OBSERVATION
Rule 6     device -> DISPOSITIVO_KW ABRE_CHAVE NAMEDEVICE FECHA_CHAVE
Rule 7     device -> DISPOSITIVO_KW ABRE_CHAVE NAMEDEVICE VIRGULA id_any FECHA_CHAVE
Rule 8     cmds -> cmd PONTO cmds
Rule 9     cmds -> cmd PONTO
Rule 10    cmd -> attrib
Rule 11    cmd -> obsact
Rule 12    cmd -> act
Rule 13    attrib -> SET id_any IGUAL var
Rule 14    attrib -> SET id_any IGUAL actexecute
Rule 15    var -> NUM
Rule 16    var -> BOOL
Rule 17    var -> NAMEDEVICE
Rule 18    var -> OBSERVATION
Rule 19    obsact -> SE obs ENTAO cmds
Rule 20    obsact -> SE obs ENTAO cmds SENAO cmds
Rule 21    obs -> id_any OPLOGIC var
Rule 22    obs -> id_any OPLOGIC var AND obs
Rule 23    act -> ACTION NAMEDEVICE
Rule 24    act -> actalert
Rule 25    actexecute -> VERIFICAR ABRE_PARENTESE NAMEDEVICE FECHA_PARENTESE
Rule 26    ACTION -> LIGAR
Rule 27    ACTION -> DESLIGAR
Rule 28    actalert -> ENVIAR_ALERTA ABRE_PARENTESE MSG FECHA_PARENTESE NAMEDEVICE
Rule 29    actalert -> ENVIAR_ALERTA ABRE_PARENTESE MSG VIRGULA id_any FECHA_PARENTESE NAMEDEVICE
Rule 30    actalert -> ENVIAR_ALERTA ABRE_PARENTESE MSG FECHA_PARENTESE PARA_TODOS devicelist
Rule 31    actalert -> ENVIAR_ALERTA ABRE_PARENTESE MSG VIRGULA id_any FECHA_PARENTESE PARA_TODOS devicelist
Rule 32    devicelist -> NAMEDEVICE VIRGULA devicelist
Rule 33    devicelist -> NAMEDEVICE

